<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 12.71 mln rand SAfrica bonds Tues.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 12.71 mln rand SAfrica bonds Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 12.71 million rand of South African bonds last Tuesday after selling 25.38 million rand's worth the day before, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>The Bond Exchange was closed on Wednesday, Thursday and Friday last week for the Christmas holiday. It was open again on Monday for business.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
